{{Quote|So, the Wookiee gets a melon but we don't?|Skad, to Boba Fett|<ref name="Chapter 7: In the Name of Honor">{{BOBF|Chapter 7: In the Name of Honor}}</ref>}}
'''Skad''' was a [[human]] [[Gender|male]] who was a member of a [[Mods|street gang]] that operated in the [[city]] of [[Mos Espa]] on the [[planet]] [[Tatooine]]. Residing in the [[Worker's District]], the gang's members often stole [[water]] due to the high prices and the lack of work available in the city. When [[Daimyo]] [[Boba Fett]] became aware of the gang's activities, he went to confront them, but learned of their circumstances, instead allowing the criminals to work for him. After being recruited by the Daimyo, Skad and the other members of the gang fought off the [[gladiator]] [[Krrsantan]] when the [[Hutt]]s known as [[the Twins]] sent him to kill Fett, and later chased the [[Mok Shaiz's majordomo|Twi'lek majordomo]] of [[Mayor of Mos Espa|Mayor]] [[Mok Shaiz]] through the streets of Mos Espa when he tried to flee. He later staked out the spaceport for reconnaissance, catching the arrival of the [[Pyke Syndicate]] operatives and reporting this to Boba and [[Fennec Shand]]<ref name="The Streets of Mos Espa" />

{{Char-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Skad appeared in "[[Chapter 3: The Streets of Mos Espa]]," the third episode of the television series ''[[Star Wars: The Book of Boba Fett]]'',<ref name="The Streets of Mos Espa" /> which was released on [[Disney+]] on [[January 12]], [[2022]].<ref name="D23">{{D23|url=everything-new-you-can-stream-on-disney-in-january-2022|text=Everything New You Can Stream on Disney+ in January 2022}}</ref> He was identified in the credits and played by [[Jordan Bolger]], while [[Ladell Preston]] served as a stunt double for the character.<ref name="The Streets of Mos Espa" />

